  "title": "古河云动态｜启动全国市场战略布局，多地分支机构陆续成立，公司迈入发展新征程",
  "date": "2022-06-20",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-70.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201049126901.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201049126901.jpg\" alt=\"6\" title=\"6\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">为更好地服务华南地区与华中地区客户，快速响应业务需求，给客户带来更好产品与服务，践行公司全国数字化业务拓展布局的重要战略方针。本月中旬，古河云科技深圳分公司与长沙销售中心相继成立，分别于深圳东方科技大厦、长沙芙蓉区壹号座品举行了隆重的揭牌仪式。董事长易小军先生率领公司管理层与行业客户及合作伙伴，共同见证古河云科技业务深入全国化布局这一重要时刻。</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201051235104.png\" alt=\"0a39c2f7a679b2df0fccb610c526a0f\" title=\"0a39c2f7a679b2df0fccb610c526a0f\" /><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">在揭牌仪式上，董事长易小军先生首先对莅临揭牌仪式的客户与合作伙伴表达了热烈的欢迎与衷心的感谢，并表示古河云科技过去5年的快速发展，离不开所有客户与合作伙伴的充分信任和大力支持。同时董事长还提到，公司在华南地区与华中地区已与中能彩聚集团等多家企业建立长期战略合作伙伴关系，希望未来能有更多的合作伙伴加入，共建多方共赢的产业生态圈。</span><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201047597428.jpg\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201048135797.jpg\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;\">分公司与销售中心的成立，是公司长期战略规划的重要组成部分，将肩负起古河云华南地区、华中地区业务发展的重担，承载着公司谋求新发展、实现新突破的重要使命，要在公司战略规划的带动下，高位起步，快速发展。</span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\">仪式上，公司高层表达了对区域负责人能带领团队，不忘初心、勇担使命，坚决完成公司各项任务要求，全力深耕数字化转型市场，肩负起古河云科技区域客户的营销与服务，积极在市场营销、履约管理、队伍建设、品牌打造等方面持续发力的美好希冀。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201051249360.png\" alt=\"96a58fe15b7b5d4b67f34cb56ddfa4c\" title=\"96a58fe15b7b5d4b67f34cb56ddfa4c\" /><br /><br /><br /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">之后交流会上，业务负责人为现场嘉宾与客户介绍了公司基本情况及产品方案信息，同时着重汇报了公司自研的“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以及基于“开河”平台，重点打造的“数字孪生建筑”与“数字农产品供应链”两条业务产品线，并对公司多个核心系统平台做了演示汇报，得到了在场嘉宾与客户的一致认可与高度评价。</span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/20226201051248563.png\" alt=\"f35b2319ae63251f7f377421ef8d38c\" title=\"f35b2319ae63251f7f377421ef8d38c\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\">新起点，新征程；砥砺奋进，必创辉煌。古河云科技作为数字化转型行业级一体化解决方案服务商，未来将持续加强科技创新能力，陆续在多地成立分支机构，落实本地化服务保障体系，逐步完成公司布局全国业务的战略目标，全面提升公司的市场经营能力和售后服务水平，以成都总部为中心，分支机构为基点，辐射全国客户，为广大客户提供专业的数字化行业级解决方案与优质的产品及服务，助力国家产业升级，为数字化进程添砖加瓦。</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-6-20/2022620104955305.jpg\" alt=\"5\" title=\"5\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></span><br /></p>",
